poly e8=-4/81*w^2*c^3*d2*x5-4/81*w^2*c^3*d4*x3+4/27*w^2*c^3*d4*x5+4/81*w^2*c^2*d2^2-16/81*w^2*c^2*d2*d4-76/243*w^2*c^2*d4^2*x5+34/243*w^2*c^2*d4^2+8/81*w^2*c^2*d4+4/27*w^2*c*d2*d4^2-16/81*w^2*c*d4^3+1/243*w^2*d4^4+8/81*w*c^2*x1*x3-16/81*w*c^2*x1*x5-8/81*w*c^2*x3^2-8/27*w*c^2*x3*x5^2+68/243*w*c^2*x3*x5+364/729*w*c^2*x5^3-40/243*w*c^2*x5^2+4/27*w*c*d2*x1+68/243*w*c*d2*x3*x5-40/243*w*c*d2*x3-44/81*w*c*d2*x5^2+124/729*w*c*d2*x5+68/243*w*c*d4*x1*x5-40/243*w*c*d4*x1+4/27*w*c*d4*x3^2-280/243*w*c*d4*x3*x5+124/729*w*c*d4*x3-76/729*w*c*d4*x5^3+1048/729*w*c*d4*x5^2-40/243*w*c*d4*x5-4/27*w*c*x1+4/27*w*c*x3+20/243*w*c*x5^2-40/243*w*c*x5-4/81*w*d2^2*x3+32/243*w*d2^2*x5-16/729*w*d2^2-8/81*w*d2*d4*x1+68/243*w*d2*d4*x3+4/81*w*d2*d4*x5^2-128/243*w*d2*d4*x5+28/729*w*d2*d4-4/81*w*d2*x5+4/81*w*d2+32/243*w*d4^2*x1+4/81*w*d4^2*x3*x5-68/243*w*d4^2*x3-4/27*w*d4^2*x5^2+1004/2187*w*d4^2*x5-4/243*w*d4^2-4/81*w*d4*x3+4/27*w*d4*x5-32/729*w*d4-4/81*x1^2*x5+2/81*x1^2-4/81*x1*x3^2+64/243*x1*x3*x5-32/729*x1*x3+4/243*x1*x5^3-20/81*x1*x5^2+28/729*x1*x5+4/81*x3^3+2/81*x3^2*x5^2-68/243*x3^2*x5+14/729*x3^2-8/81*x3*x5^3+1004/2187*x3*x5^2-8/243*x3*x5-4/2187*x5^5+190/2187*x5^4-1528/6561*x5^3+10/729*x5^2;
ideal E=w,x1,x3,x5;
ideal GE=std(E);
poly L1=reduce(diff(e1,w)+diff(e1,c)*tc+diff(e1,d2)*td2+diff(e1,d4)*td4+diff(e1,x1)*tx1+diff(e1,x3)*tx3+diff(e1,x5)*tx5,GE);
poly L3=reduce(diff(e3,w)+diff(e3,c)*tc+diff(e3,d2)*td2+diff(e3,d4)*td4+diff(e3,x1)*tx1+diff(e3,x3)*tx3+diff(e3,x5)*tx5,GE);
poly L5=reduce(diff(e5,w)+diff(e5,c)*tc+diff(e5,d2)*td2+diff(e5,d4)*td4+diff(e5,x1)*tx1+diff(e5,x3)*tx3+diff(e5,x5)*tx5,GE);
poly L7=reduce(diff(e7,w)+diff(e7,c)*tc+diff(e7,d2)*td2+diff(e7,d4)*td4+diff(e7,x1)*tx1+diff(e7,x3)*tx3+diff(e7,x5)*tx5,GE);
poly L2=reduce(diff(e2,w)+diff(e2,c)*tc+diff(e2,d2)*td2+diff(e2,d4)*td4+diff(e2,x1)*tx1+diff(e2,x3)*tx3+diff(e2,x5)*tx5,GE);
poly L4=reduce(diff(e4,w)+diff(e4,c)*tc+diff(e4,d2)*td2+diff(e4,d4)*td4+diff(e4,x1)*tx1+diff(e4,x3)*tx3+diff(e4,x5)*tx5,GE);
poly u=d2-d4;
poly F2=u^2+2*d4*(1-u);
poly F4=2*u^2-3*u+d4*(1-u);
ideal IL24=L2,L4;
ideal GL24=std(IL24);
ideal IF24=F2,F4;
ideal GF24=std(IF24);
ideal IT=d2-2*d4,d4*(d4-2);
ideal GT=std(IT);
int l_to_f=1;for(int ilf=1;ilf<=size(GL24);ilf++){if(reduce(GL24[ilf],GF24)!=0){l_to_f=0;}}
int f_to_l=1;for(int ifl=1;ifl<=size(GF24);ifl++){if(reduce(GF24[ifl],GL24)!=0){f_to_l=0;}}
int f_to_t=1;for(int ift=1;ift<=size(GF24);ift++){if(reduce(GF24[ift],GT)!=0){f_to_t=0;}}
int t_to_f=1;for(int itf=1;itf<=size(GT);itf++){if(reduce(GT[itf],GF24)!=0){t_to_f=0;}}
ideal IJ0=L1,L3,L5,d2,d4;
ideal J0=std(IJ0);
ideal IT0=d2,d4,tx1,tx3,tx5;
ideal T0=std(IT0);
int j0_to_t0=1;for(int ij0=1;ij0<=size(J0);ij0++){if(reduce(J0[ij0],T0)!=0){j0_to_t0=0;}}
int t0_to_j0=1;for(int it0=1;it0<=size(T0);it0++){if(reduce(T0[it0],J0)!=0){t0_to_j0=0;}}
poly L7at0=reduce(L7,T0);
ideal IJ42=L1,L3,L5,d2-4,d4-2;
ideal J42=std(IJ42);
ideal IT42=d2-4,d4-2,tx1-8*c-8/3,tx3-20*c-88/9,tx5-12*c-16/3;
ideal T42=std(IT42);
int j42_to_t42=1;for(int ij42=1;ij42<=size(J42);ij42++){if(reduce(J42[ij42],T42)!=0){j42_to_t42=0;}}
int t42_to_j42=1;for(int it42=1;it42<=size(T42);it42++){if(reduce(T42[it42],J42)!=0){t42_to_j42=0;}}
poly L7at42=reduce(L7,T42);
int residual42=0;if(L7at42==-16/27){residual42=1;}
print("Q8-W0-OVERLAP-HORIZONTAL-TANGENT");
print("engine=std");
print("order=dp");
print("L2="+string(L2));
print("L4="+string(L4));
print("L24_F24_ideal_identity="+string(l_to_f*f_to_l));
print("F24_root_ideal_identity="+string(f_to_t*t_to_f));
print("F24_two_point_scheme="+string(f_to_t*t_to_f));
print("branch0_linear_ideal_identity="+string(j0_to_t0*t0_to_j0));
print("branch0_L7="+string(L7at0));
print("branch42_linear_ideal_identity="+string(j42_to_t42*t42_to_j42));
print("branch42_L7="+string(L7at42));
print("branch42_scaled_L7="+string(729*L7at42));
print("branch42_residual_identity="+string(residual42));
print("F24_BASIS_BEGIN");
GF24;
print("F24_BASIS_END");
print("BRANCH0_BASIS_BEGIN");
J0;
print("BRANCH0_BASIS_END");
print("BRANCH42_BASIS_BEGIN");
J42;
print("BRANCH42_BASIS_END");
print("Q8_W0_OVERLAP_HORIZONTAL_TANGENT_PASS");
exit;
